            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the descendants of Esau, also called Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.26.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 26.34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau married Canaanite women: Adah, the daughter of Elon the Hittite; Oholibamah, the daughter of Anah son",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36.2; 36.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some ancient translations",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "son",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "daughter",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "granddaughter.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of Zibeon the Hivite; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 28.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Basemath, the daughter of Ishmael and sister of Nebaioth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adah bore Eliphaz; Basemath bore Reuel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Oholibamah bore Jeush, Jalam, and Korah. All these sons were born to Esau in the land of Canaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Esau took his wives, his sons, his daughters, and all the people of his house, together with all his livestock and all the possessions he had acquired in the land of Canaan, and went away from his brother Jacob to another land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He left because the land where he and Jacob were living was not able to support them; they had too much livestock and could no longer stay together. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Esau lived in the hill country of Edom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the descendants of Esau, the ancestor of the Edomites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau's wife Adah bore him one son, Eliphaz, and Eliphaz had five sons: Teman, Omar, Zepho, Gatam, and Kenaz. And by another wife, Timna, he had one more son, Amalek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.10+GEN.36.11+GEN.36.12+GEN.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.10",
              "GEN.36.11",
              "GEN.36.12",
              "GEN.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau's wife Basemath bore him one son, Reuel, and Reuel had four sons: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, and Mizzah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.10+GEN.36.11+GEN.36.12+GEN.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.10",
              "GEN.36.11",
              "GEN.36.12",
              "GEN.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.10+GEN.36.11+GEN.36.12+GEN.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.10",
              "GEN.36.11",
              "GEN.36.12",
              "GEN.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
